\\\\text{3S}_{\\\\frac{1}{2}}$: 589.756 nm\\n#### Substructure\\n- Hyperfine \
structure neglected\\n- Zeeman structure neglected\\n- 2 total \
sublevels\\n#### Density matrix elements\\n- All populations included\\n- \
